# job-search-agent-film reel: ignore caches, intermediates, review cuts, frames and every MP4.
# The master (exports/**/*.mp4) is ignored; README.md will record its filename, size and SHA-256.
# exports/ is ignored in full (see below), so the .verified.json files in it are ignored too.
*.mp4
media/
clips/
mp3/
manim/
mp4/
_qc/frames/
_superseded/
.audio.log
__pycache__/

# Local build ledgers (build-state.json holds absolute local paths).
build-state.json
todo.json
ToDo.md
STATUS.md

# exports/ holds the master and its .verified.json, which records absolute local paths; both are ignored.
exports/
MASTERCHECK.md
